&lt;p&gt;💰£42,500 pro rata&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role will be based in our London office on a hybrid basis (2 days per week in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible full-time working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Top-spec Macbook to use over the course of your time with us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Knowledge-sharing sessions with your squad and wider discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👯 Team and company wide socials / events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍝 Lunch on Monzo twice a week from a range of street food vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our application process involves three main stages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Submit your application with the short questions answered&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you’re successful, we’ll invite you to complete an exercise to demonstrate your programming and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If all goes well, you’ll have your final interviews with members of our engineering team via Google Meet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The closing date for applications is 1st of November 2026, but we encourage you to apply as soon as possible as we will be extending offers on a rolling basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/engineering-and-data-internships-at-monzo&quot;&gt;our blog&lt;/a&gt; to hear from our recent Interns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#EP-1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;📍London or UK Remote | 💰 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/documents/engineering-progression-framework-v4-1.pdf&quot;&gt;Engineer III&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation: £85,000 - £110,000 +&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; | &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/technology&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Engineering Teams:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have around 650 engineers across Monzo who design and build our in-house banking platform. We have big ambitions for the future, and technology plays a big role in creating a bank our customers want, so engineers at Monzo collaborate across disciplines to solve interesting challenges throughout the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These range from the products our customers use everyday to underlying infrastructure, security, payments and finance, customer operations, financial crime, and data, to name just a few areas. As a bank, there is scope for impact across a huge number of opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;We value meeting in person but we don&#39;t have a mandated requirement on office attendance, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency 🕣✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you prefer to work part-time, we&#39;ll make this happen whenever we can - whether this is to help you meet other commitments or strike a great work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have strong experience working on the backend of a technology product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you want to be involved in building a product that you (and the people you know) use every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have a product mindset: you care about customer outcomes and you want to make data-informed decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you’re comfortable working in a team that deals with ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you’re interested in distributed systems and writing resilient software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you have some experience with strongly-typed languages (Go, Java, C, Scala etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;you think you’d enjoy the kind of work we’re doing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the look out for L40 Engineers at the moment, you can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/documents/engineering-progression-framework-v4-1.pdf&quot;&gt;Engineering Progression Framework&lt;/a&gt; you will be interviewed across the whole framework, so if you&#39;re not sure what level you&#39;re aiming for chat to your recruiter!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything thats listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be working on:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hire very technically agnostic so &lt;strong&gt;whilst we use the below technologies we do not expect prior knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be fully supported in our organised onboarding to get up to speed in the below:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://golang.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to write our application code (there’s an excellent interactive Go tutorial &lt;a href=&quot;https://tour.golang.org/welcome/1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://cassandra.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cassandra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most persistent data storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kafka.apache.org/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for our asynchronous message queue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://kubernetes.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.docker.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to schedule and run our services&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.envoyproxy.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envoy Proxy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for RPC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://aws.amazon.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our production infrastructure and&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.google.com/&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;GCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for most of our data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React for our public web apps and internal tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We also have physical datacenters with actual cables to connect to various third parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process involves three main stages:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take home task or pair coding exercise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview: including a system design and a behavioural interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 4 weeks but we will always work around your availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our engineers has written a detailed blog on their experience through this process, for extra details, hints and tips please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/2022/03/23/demystifying-the-backend-engineering-interview-process&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;£85,000 - £110,000&lt;/span&gt; base salary &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;+&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Incentive Awards tied to your performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕And much more, see our full list of benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re usually always hiring for Backend Engineers, so there&#39;s no closing date for this job.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ZM1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£85,000 - £115,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of our Control Discipline change agenda, building the controls product platform that powers safe growth at Monzo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we don’t treat risk and controls as a bureaucratic governance process. We treat our control framework, tools, and data pipelines as an internal &lt;em&gt;product&lt;/em&gt; - designed to give engineers, product managers, and business leads the ability to ship fast - and safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Senior Controls Product Manager&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to join our newly established Controls Product &amp;amp; Enablement team within our Controls Discipline. Sitting at the intersection of Product, Risk, Data, and Engineering, you will act as the Product Lead for Monzo’s core risk lifecycles (Issues, RCSAs, Controls, Policy, Reg Traceability).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t just write requirement docs for someone else to build - you are a builder yourself. You’ll prototype low-code tools, leverage AI models, interrogate data pipelines, and architect automated workflows to turn manual risk friction into seamless, automated self-service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ Our Controls team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will sit within the &lt;em&gt;Controls Product &amp;amp; Enablement&lt;/em&gt; team which is part of the wider Controls Discipline&amp;nbsp; in Monzo’s 1st line of defence&amp;nbsp; Our teams work closely with cross-functional teams across the organisation including Technology, Data, Product, Operations as well and Risk &amp;amp; Compliance (the 2nd line of defence).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As this is a newly established team (wherein you’ll have two direct reports already working in the team as data and automation specialists), this role holder needs to bring a flexible and adaptable mindset, as well as a willingness to deal with ambiguity as the team establishes its operating rhythm and embeds itself within the wider business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 What you’ll do (Your Product Ownership Scope)…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Controls Product Roadmap: Define the vision, strategy, and backlog for Monzo’s internal risk products, replacing static, manual cycles with smart, data-driven platforms (SmartSuite, Zango, Looker, and native AI integrations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Prototyping &amp;amp; Automation: Directly design, prototype, and build automated workflows, API integrations, and low-code/no-code solutions. You&#39;ll take an idea from a problem statement to a working MVP before partnering with core Engineering (if necessary) to scale or industrialise it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer AI in Risk Management: Champion AI adoption across the discipline. Experiment with LLM prompting, custom agents, and automated evidence-gathering tools to solve complex control problems and dramatically reduce manual drag for Monzo staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build for Real-Time Risk Intelligence: Drive the shift from annual &quot;point-in-time&quot; assessments to continuous, automated monitoring. Design data triggers (e.g., incident spikes, change flags) that alert risk owners in real time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product Enablement &amp;amp; Adoption: Ensure high-impact adoption. Work closely with first line risk owners and Risk Partners to deliver clear &quot;write once&quot; guidance, intuitive UI/UX workflows, and enablement that allows teams to self-serve effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Execution &amp;amp; Delivery: Maintain momentum across the team’s delivery plan (guiding 2 specialised data/automation direct reports), keeping senior stakeholders engaged and removing blockers without bureaucratic overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think like a Product Manager: You obsess over user problems, value vs. effort prioritization, user experience, and shipping MVPs quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a Hands-On Builder: You can get under the hood with data and automation. You&#39;re comfortable with SQL, Python (or similar), APIs, workflow tools, or low-code environments to build a working prototype yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re AI-Curious &amp;amp; Practical: You actively experiment with AI/LLMs to automate manual tasks and make workflows smarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You Understand Risk &amp;amp; Controls: You understand fundamental risk concepts (control design, RCSAs, issue management) and see the massive opportunity to transform them through tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You Thrive in Ambiguity: You enjoy starting from first principles in a fast-paced environment and turning messy operational problems into slick, scalable digital solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in leading teams through change programmes, ideally within Financial Services Controls functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are hands-on and take satisfaction in supporting colleagues, projects or tasks however big or small - and can take a range of stakeholders on the journey with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited by what we’re doing at Monzo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ℹ️ This role &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;isn’t &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your technology and data experience has primarily involved defining requirements for Data or Engineering teams to build, rather than building solutions yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You aren&#39;t comfortable getting hands-on with data, automation tooling and technical problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You aren’t comfortable with ambiguity, or thinking from first principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t enjoy working in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You aren’t happy taking an MVP approach and doing what’s good enough for now with iterative changes to follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equally, if your experience is primarily technical and you don&#39;t have sufficient understanding of risk and controls to translate control problems into effective solutions, this role is unlikely to be the right fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £85,000 - £115,000 ➕Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌈 The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short call with a Monzo Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video-call with Hiring Manager (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-Loop: 3 x video-call interviews (covering Technical, Behaviours, and Leadership)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 4-5 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo.&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt; You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏳&lt;strong&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;br&gt;#CM-1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/Remote (UK) | 💰£43,300 to £58,500 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our team ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credit Platform&#39;s mission is to systematise credit analysis and decisioning across Monzo&#39;s products, data and geographies.⁠&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We source, onboard and manage the credit bureau and external-data suppliers that power underwriting in the UK and, increasingly, across the EU. You&#39;ll join a small, high-performing team supporting an ambitious multi-market growth agenda.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the sourcing, onboarding and day-to-day management of Credit Reference Agencies and external-data suppliers across consumer and commercial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining Monzo&#39;s single source of truth on what bureau (borrowing) data and products we hold, what we&#39;re contracted for, and how each is used&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking and reconciling spend against supplier volumes and budgets, and surfacing cost-optimisation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating supplier onboarding steps with Legal, Data Protection, Security and Procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping test and evaluate new CRA and alternative-data products, and writing up findings for the squad to evaluate further&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning end-to-end one or more supplier relationships or EU workstreams (e.g. Open Banking scoring, a market&#39;s bureau stack), and deputising for the Credit Bureau Relationship Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading discrete procurement/contract-lifecycle activities and shaping supplier strategy in your area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re highly organised and thrive on keeping many moving parts in order i.e tracking actions, deadlines and follow-ups so nothing slips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a clear, confident communicator, comfortable coordinating with suppliers and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a sharp eye for detail across&amp;nbsp; invoices, contracts, trackers and records stay accurate in your hands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re proactive and self-starting: you chase things down and keep work moving without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re genuinely curious about credit-bureau data, suppliers and how they support lending&amp;nbsp; and keen to build that domain knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: exposure to procurement, supplier/vendor management, or financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £43,300 to £58,500 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1) Recruiter call&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2) Initial hiring manager call&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3) Final stage (x2 interviews) consisting of a role specific interview and a collaboration interview&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&lt;/p&gt;
